Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.52,0:00:08.87,Line,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur0.6}小姐，下雪了。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.92,0:00:17.31,Line,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur0.6}这么冷还叫我出来？北极熊你是不是想冻死我！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.12,0:00:21.12,Line,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur0.6}……哼，这还差不多。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.72,0:00:29.05,Line,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur0.6}笑什么笑！再笑扣你工资。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.52,0:00:34.83,Line,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur0.6}慢点慢点——
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.00,0:00:38.43,Line,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur0.6}好吧，再快一点！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.30,Line,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur0.6}像您。
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.57,0:00:46.32,Line,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur0.6}哪里像！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.59,0:00:48.51,Line,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\blur0.6}……眼睛挺像的。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:05.70,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,900)\blur0.8}今年的第一场雪，下得很认真。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:55.80,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(700,900)\blur0.8}最好的冬天，是有人记得你怕冷。
